  <div class="panel">
    <h2>{{ t('The two dials over time', '两大指标随时间变化') }}
      {{ help("History of the growth (green) and inflation (red) scores. Zero-line crossings are where regimes change; persistent readings near ±0.5 are strong regimes; hovering near zero = mixed, choppy environment.", "增长（绿）与通胀（红）评分的历史走势。穿越零轴处即周期切换；持续接近 ±0.5 的读数代表强周期；徘徊在零附近 = 混杂、震荡的环境。") }}
    </h2>
